# AGC SDD Workflow

Every F1.xx feature follows:

GitHub Issue
→ Specify
→ Spec Review
→ Plan
→ Plan Review
→ Tasks
→ Analyze
→ Implement
→ Verify
→ PR
→ PRE
→ Testing
→ PRO
→ Done

## Stage Boundaries

### Specify

Produces:

spec.md

Must stop after specification generation and
configured post-specification hooks.

### Plan

Produces:

plan.md

Must not begin until spec.md has been approved.

### Tasks

Produces:

tasks.md

Must not begin until plan.md has been approved.

### Implement

May only begin when:

- spec.md exists
- plan.md exists
- tasks.md exists
- required dependencies are satisfied

### Completion

Implementation is not complete merely because
all tasks are checked.

Verification must pass before the feature can
move to Review/Testing.